# Healthy vs red blotch vs leafroll, inside each variety

One mean spectrum per leaf; leaves with both viruses left out. R2 = share of the variety's spectral variance between the groups; chance = average R2 of shuffled labels; p = 999 shuffles within rows; p Holm = corrected for all 26 tests (use this one: < 0.05 = significant). max |d| = largest per-band Cohen's d (0.5 medium, 0.8 large). AUC = leave-one-row-out logistic regression on SNV spectra, within rows (0.5 = guessing; '-' = a group has < 10 leaves).

